      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Timely Distraction",
      "actions": "reaction",
      "category": "defensive",
      "text": "Trigger A creature Heuberk can see within his melee reach misses him with a melee Strike.\n\n---\n\nEffect Heuberk attempts to Feint the creature. If it's not Heuberk's turn and he gets a success, the effect applies on his next turn."
