      "name": "Identify an Opening",
      "actions": 1,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "auditory",
        "linguistic"
      ],
      "text": "Requirements A creature is Off-Guard against Heuberk's next melee attack.\n\n---\n\nEffect Heuberk points out a lapse in the creature's defenses. The creature is off-guard against all melee attacks attempted by any of Heuberk's allies who hear and understand this instruction until the start of Heuberk's next turn."
    },
